; memoria: LOAD, STORE eta STORETEXT; idatzi gabeko gelaxkak 0 dira
; expect-output: sum=55 unwritten=0 text=81,79,65,0 next=104
REGSET R1 1
REGSET R3 10
REGSET R8 1
fill:
STORE R1 R1
ADD R1 R1 R8
IFGT R1 R3 summed
JUMP fill
summed:
REGSET R1 1
REGSET R4 0
add:
LOAD R5 R1
ADD R4 R4 R5
ADD R1 R1 R8
IFGT R1 R3 done
JUMP add
done:
REGSET R6 5000
LOAD R7 R6
REGSET R9 100
STORETEXT R9 "QOA"
REGSET R10 100
LOAD R11 R10
REGSET R10 101
LOAD R12 R10
REGSET R10 102
LOAD R13 R10
REGSET R10 103
LOAD R14 R10
PRINTF "sum={} unwritten={} text={},{},{},{} next={}\n" R4 R7 R11 R12 R13 R14 R9
